<article class="env-theorem" id="03V0">
  <p><a class="environment-identifier" href="/tag/03V0">Theorem <span data-tag="03V0">64.20.2</span> <span class="named">(Adic sheaves)</span>.</a>  Let $X$ be a scheme of finite type over a finite field $k$, and $\mathcal{F}$ a $\mathbf{Q}_\ell $-sheaf on $X$. Then </p>
  <div class="equation">
  \[  L(X, \mathcal{F}) = \prod \nolimits _ i \det (1 - \pi _ X^*T |_{H_ c^ i(X_{\bar k} , \mathcal{F})})^{(-1)^{i + 1}} \in \mathbf{Q}_\ell [[T]].  \]
</div>
